## Final flow summary

```
Manual trigger ──► PO Review (HITL) ──[completed/Approve]──► Log PO Approved
                         │
                   [Reject → ends]
```

**Three nodes, two edges, fully wired:**

| Node | ID | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Manual trigger | `start` | Kicks off the flow; passes in PO data |
| Purchase Order Review | `poReview1` | HITL QuickForm, **High** priority |
| Log PO Approved | `logApproved1` | Script: `console.log("PO approved.")` |

**Edges:**
- `start` → `poReview1` (trigger fires the review task)
- `poReview1` `completed` → `logApproved1` (only Approve reaches this — Reject terminates at the HITL node itself)

**Runtime variables available downstream if you ever extend this:**
- `$vars.poReview1.status` → `"Approve"` or `"Reject"`
- `$vars.poReview1.output.comments` → reviewer's notes

